  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening safe and regular pathways for Ivorian workers and students for sustainable development in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the expansion of safe and regular migration pathways for workers and students from C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire. Through collaboration with government institutions, the private sector, and international partners, it strengthens migration governance, promotes dialogue on labour and skills mobility, and improves access to information on regular migration pathways. The initiative also helps build the capacity of key stakeholders and raises awareness among prospective migrants, contributing to safer migration processes that benefit migrants, their families, and communities in both origin and destination countries.</narrative>
  </description>
